---
---

<section id="features" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-buddy-cyan/30 bg-buddy-cyan/10 text-buddy-cyan text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        <span>Desktop Superpowers</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Built for Windows. <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-gradient">Engineered for Delight.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-buddy-muted">
        Under the nostalgic desktop companion charm lives a modern, high-performance architecture built in Rust and WebGL.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid Container -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- 1. Universal Skeleton Retargeting (Wide Card) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-2xl border border-buddy-border bg-buddy-card/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-buddy-cyan/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-64 h-64 bg-buddy-cyan/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-buddy-cyan/10 border border-buddy-cyan/30 flex items-center justify-center text-buddy-cyan text-xl">
            🦴
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white">Universal Rig Retargeting</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-buddy-cyan font-mono">GLB • glTF • VRM • Mixamo FBX</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-buddy-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Drop any 3D humanoid character file onto Buddy or into Settings. Bones from Mixamo, Unreal Engine, and VRoid are automatically mapped in real time at load. Every dance, idle fidget, and gesture works on every model without baking or rigging per mesh.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-buddy-bg border border-buddy-border text-buddy-text">Rocco 3D Scan</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-buddy-bg border border-buddy-border text-buddy-text">Mannequin</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-buddy-bg border border-buddy-border text-buddy-text">T-800 Endoskeleton</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-buddy-bg border border-buddy-border text-buddy-text">2D Pixel Pal</span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-buddy-cyan/20 border border-buddy-cyan/40 text-buddy-cyan font-semibold">+ Any Mixamo Rig</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. 100% Offline Privacy (Single Card) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-buddy-border bg-buddy-card/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400 text-xl mb-4">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Zero Telemetry & Local Privacy</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-buddy-muted leading-relaxed">
          Audio is analyzed on-device via WASAPI loopback without recording. Webcam mocap runs through local MediaPipe. API keys stay securely inside Windows Credential Manager.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Local Neural Speech (Single Card) -->
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-buddy-border bg-buddy-card/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-buddy-purple/10 border border-buddy-purple/30 flex items-center justify-center text-buddy-purple text-xl mb-4">
          🎙️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Offline Neural Speech</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-buddy-muted leading-relaxed">
          Includes Piper neural TTS. High-fidelity voice models run 100% offline on your CPU with sub-100ms latency. No cloud TTS billing required.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Multi-Engine AI Brain (Wide Card) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-2xl border border-buddy-border bg-buddy-card/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 sm:p-8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-buddy-purple/40 transition-colors">
        <div class="absolute -left-10 -bottom-10 w-64 h-64 bg-buddy-purple/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-buddy-purple/10 border border-buddy-purple/30 flex items-center justify-center text-buddy-purple text-xl">
            🧠
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white">Multi-Engine AI Brain</h3>
            <span class="text-xs text-buddy-purple font-mono">Groq • Gemini • Ollama • GPT-Live</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-buddy-muted leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
          Bring whatever AI provider you prefer. Groq gives lightning-fast answers on free tiers; Google Gemini offers massive context; Ollama runs completely disconnected; and OpenAI GPT-Live powers true conversational duplex voice chat.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-buddy-text">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Free Groq Setup</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span> Google Gemini Free Tier</span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span> Local Ollama Models</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
